      "updated_at": "2025-02-22T09:49:30Z",
      "body": "There was a redundant cast that I missed. I also renamed some parameters that I incorrectly renamed (using `Py_UNUSED(ignored)` is useless, it doesn't tell you at first glance whether it's a NOARGS or a ONEARG/VARARGS method while `Py_UNUSED(dummy)`, `Py_UNUSED(arg)` and `Py_UNUSED(args)` would tell you more).",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "reactions": {
